Para. 3 let. bbis — Inserted by Annex No II 5 of the Energy Act of 30 Sept. 2016, in force since 1 Jan. 2018 (AS 2017 6839; BBl 2013 7561).
Para. 3 let. bter — Inserted by Annex No II 5 of the Energy Act of 30 Sept. 2016, in force since 1 Jan. 2018 (AS 2017 6839; BBl 2013 7561).
